537
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:18,200
nozzle.

538
00:27:18,300 --> 00:27:21,400
These machines are designed so that only 15% of the water

539
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:26,000
flashes into steam as it exits the nozzle.

540
00:27:26,100 --> 00:27:30,300
The 85% water, 15% steam ratio provides the best cleaning

541
00:27:30,301 --> 00:27:32,300
power.

542
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:35,240
The tremendous expansion of the steam accelerates the water

543
00:27:35,340 --> 00:27:39,340
droplets so that they bombard the surface to be cleaned.

544
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:42,740
Pressure washers that just use hot water aren't as effective

545
00:27:42,840 --> 00:27:44,840
when dealing with grease and grime,

546
00:27:44,940 --> 00:27:49,060
and 100% steam would melt the grease but not wash it away.

547
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:51,960
In addition to cleaning heavy equipment like this,

548
00:27:52,060 --> 00:27:54,260
there are other uses for steam cleaners,

549
00:27:54,360 --> 00:27:56,660
such as blasting away snow and ice.

550
00:27:56,661 --> 00:28:00,560
It'll clean gum, sticky substances off the sidewalks.

551
00:28:00,660 --> 00:28:03,300
It can be used to clean just about anything.

552
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:05,100
The Sioux Corporation manufactures

