00:31:44,600 --> 00:31:47,700
In New York, enormous boilers send steam surging

631
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:51,200
under the city's streets and into some of the world's most

632
00:31:51,300 --> 00:31:54,840
famous skyscrapers, unless things go wrong.

